<VI _name="lvai_move_to_folder_class.vi" description="Moves members of ONE .lvclass into a virtual folder of that class\2C creating the folder at the class root when it is not there\2C through LabVIEW's own VI Server\3A Project\3AActive Project -&gt; Application -&gt; LVClass.Open -&gt; {LV.Library} Modifications Bit Set -&gt; {LV.Library} Get All Descendents (Type = item type) and {LV.ProjectItem} Name per item -&gt; Search 1D Array per wanted name -&gt; {LV.Library} Get All Descendents (Type Folder) and Search for the folder -&gt; {LV.Library} AddItem (Type Folder) when it is missing -&gt; {LV.ProjectItem} Move (New Parent = the folder) per item -&gt; {LV.LVClassLibrary} Save. NOTHING IS MOVED unless every wanted name was found AND the class carries no unsaved changes\3B Item Indices and Unsaved say which stopped it. A virtual folder lives only in the .lvclass\2C so a move changes no file but the class\2C no qualified name and no link. The route (AddItem Folder\2C Get All Descendents\2C Move\2C Save) is a skill kit helper measured on every member of 15 classes with the project OPEN and ACTIVE (LabVIEW 2026 Q3\2C 2026-10-11/12)\3B the all-or-nothing guard and the unsaved-changes guard are new and unmeasured.">
